    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,0</mo></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>B</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;are the vertices of a triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>, then the value of <math><mi>θ</mi></math> for which the triangle has the maximum area&nbsp;is&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>where</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>∈</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math>"
